time span. The ¥ ô able to process the information and make
meaningful connections to ä it. Drama drives home its
information çly than narr ative prose. The obvious example is how in
a book an important thought in someone’ s mind · written ±
reader . I n film, especially if voiceover narration ¬ used, sc reenwriters
